{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
EDITORIAL PRODUCT CARD
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Wraps the theme's own product card (snippets/product-card.liquid) so the editorial collection sections keep every
Prestige card function as-is: colour swatches that switch the image to the variant image (hover + click), secondary
image on hover, quick add "+" / quick buy modal, badges, price display. Layout is restyled to the design in
assets/reve-editorial.css (.rv-track .product-card). The wishlist heart is added on top.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="rv-card">
  {%- render 'product-card', product: product, show_badges: true, show_vendor: false, show_rating: false, show_secondary_image: true, quick_buy_context: 'rv' -%}
  <button type="button" class="rv-wish" data-rv-wish="{{ product.handle }}" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Add to wishlist">{% render 'reve-icon', icon: 'heart' %}</button>
</div>
